    <li><a href="https://gamefaqs.gamespot.com/ps/573506-shin-super-robot-taisen/faqs/4592" rel="noopener" target="_blank">GameFAQs FAQ（J_Ong 著）</a>（全关埋藏道具坐标，含作者的 ±1 坐标注记）</li>
